      "answer": 1,
      "why": "With no past verb, **কাল** means tomorrow; আজ = today."
    },
    {
      "id": "e04",
      "type": "script_recognize",
      "glyph": "মিষ্টি",
      "options": [
        "mitti (no sh)",
        "mishiti (an i between sh and t)",
        "mishti (ষ্ট: sh + t)",
        "misht (no final i)"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "why": "**ষ্ট** stacks ষ (sh) on ট (t) with no vowel between; ি adds the final i."
    },
    {
      "id": "e05",
      "type": "reading",
      "title": "Mangoes at the bazaar",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "ভাই, এই আমগুলো কত?",
          "tr": "bhai, ei amgulo koto?",
          "en": "Brother, how much are these mangoes?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Shopkeeper",
          "bn": "একশ টাকা কেজি।",
          "tr": "eksho taka keji.",
          "en": "A hundred taka a kilo."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "এত দাম কেন? একটু কম রাখেন।",
          "tr": "eto dam keno? ektu kom rakhen.",
          "en": "Why so expensive? Please lower it a little."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Shopkeeper",
          "bn": "ঠিক আছে, আশি টাকা দেন।",
          "tr": "thik achhe, ashi taka den.",
          "en": "OK, give me eighty taka."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "আচ্ছা, আমাকে দুই কেজি দেন।",
          "tr": "achchha, amake dui keji den.",
          "en": "OK, please give me two kilos."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Shopkeeper",
          "bn": "আর কিছু লাগবে?",
          "tr": "ar kichhu lagbe?",
          "en": "Do you need anything else?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "না, লাগবে না, ধন্যবাদ।",
          "tr": "na, lagbe na, dhonnobad.",
          "en": "No, I don't need anything, thank you."
        }
      ],
      "question": "In the end, what price per kilo do they agree on?",
      "options": [
        "100 taka",
        "80 taka",
        "160 taka"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "why": "The shopkeeper drops from **একশ** (100) to **আশি** (80) a kilo; two kilos make 160."
    },
    {
      "id": "e06",
      "type": "listen_meaning",
      "audio": {
        "bn": "এখন সাড়ে তিনটা বাজে।",
        "tr": "ekhon share tinta baje.",
        "en": "It's half past three now."
      },
      "options": [
        "It's three o'clock now.",
        "It's quarter past three now.",
        "It's half past two now.",
        "It's half past three now."
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "why": "**সাড়ে তিনটা** = 3:30. 3:15 is সোয়া তিনটা, and 2:30 is আড়াইটা."
    },
